sed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/316","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/316","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/316/labels","id":10687661,"node_id":"MI_kwDOCFbutM4AoxSt","number":316,"title":"3.8.3","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":46,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-03-15T08:52:39Z","updated_at":"2024-04-11T14:28:38Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2024-03-15T17:50:56Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2024-03-05T18:38:54Z","updated_at":"2024-03-15T09:00:14Z","closed_at":"2024-03-13T10:35:48Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nUsing `web/templates` as a template root with `TemplateRootBuildItem`, it's not adding the right `NativeImageResourceBuildItem`\r\n\r\nSee:\r\n```java\r\n2024-03-05 18:10:10,609 DEBUG [io.qua.qut.dep.QuteProcessor] (build-32) Produce template build items [filePath: WebResource/page1.html, fullPath: templates/WebResource/page1.html, originalPath: /Users/adamevin/workspace/redhat/quarkiverse/quarkus-web-bundler/integration-tests/target/classes/web/templates/WebResource/page1.html\r\n```\r\n\r\nin https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/main/extensions/qute/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/qute/deployment/QuteProcessor.java#L3393\r\n\r\nit's adding the `fullPath` in the `NativeImageResourceBuildItem` which is `templates/WebResource/page1.html` it should be `web/templates/WebResource/page1.html`\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n\r\n3.8.1\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is what I mentioned in https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-web-bundler/pull/165#pullrequestreview-1888549715\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/39197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarku